      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p14_b5",
      "text": "practitioners already use. The importance-sampling estimator above is the original recipe:\nestimate the gradient of the nominal promptwise target \u27e8\u03c0\u03b8(\u00b7 | x), \u02c6r(x)\u27e9from sampled\ncompletions and then ascend along that estimate. Following Shao et al. [2024], GRPO\nstabilizes that recipe by grouping completions promptwise, replacing raw rewards by\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        228.96,
        524.96,
        294.63
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        288,
        915,
