      "is_math": true,
      "char_count": 344,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p14_b6",
      "text": "normalized within-group advantages, and clipping the importance ratio inside the policy\nupdate. Concretely, for each prompt x we sample a group of completions\n",
      "bbox": [
